message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MetricFlowX"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
url: "https://luca-heltai.github.io/metric-flow-x/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A C++/deal.II implementation of an MPI-parallel implicit solver for one-dimensional **navier-stokes flow models** defined on **metric networks embedded in three-dimensional space**. The space discretization is based on an HDG-type (hybridized) monolithic system, which is then solved in time via the SUNDIALS Differential-Algebraic equation solver (IDA).
